```bash
cp perfect_input.nc filter_input.nc
```

**This step is unique to B-grid — not needed in Lorenz 96.**

The filter needs `filter_input.nc` to create its initial ensemble.
Because `perturb_from_single_instance = .true.`, it reads this single
